Hi {Owner},

I build websites and software for gym and fitness club groups around {City}. {Business Name} looks great in its posts, but the site puts every club on one page and joining stops at an enquiry form.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: a club finder with a page and timetable for each club, membership tiers side by side, online joining, a corporate membership page and a careers hub, with marked placeholders where your photos would go. It hands joins and bookings to the member system you already run:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, the build runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, timetable sync and changes. If not, no problem, the sample comes down at the end of the month.

Worth thirty minutes with you and whoever owns the member system?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
